            <ArticleTitle>[The use of the vacuum phonophoresis of peloidin on patients with the neurological syndromes of lumbar osteochondrosis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>30-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Isotope capillary permeability and electroneuromyography were employed to study potency of peloidin vacuum-phonophoresis and its combination with pelobalneotherapy for lumbar osteochondrosis (LO). Altogether 108 patients with LO neurological syndromes were treated. Peloidin vacuum-phonophoresis proved a pathogenetic treatment of the condition valuable at all stages of LO patients rehabilitation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
